    "text": "For the reaction given below :<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bac9703c-48d7-43e3-a913-f2f5f1041d8f-image.png\" style=\"width: 366px; height: 151px;\" /><br />The compound which is not formed as a product in the reaction is a :",
